        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">© {year} Dallas Door Pros. All rights reserved. <span class="inline-block align-middle">Built &amp; Maintained by <a href="https://cojovi.com" class="underline hover:text-primary-400" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cojovi.com</a></span></p>
        <div class="flex space-x-6 mt-4 md:mt-0">
